flowchart TD
    A([Stream starts]) --> B[Proxy receives RTMP publish]
    B --> C[Proxy notifies Controller]
    C --> D[Controller records Proxy ownership and generation]
    D --> E[Controller persists ownership in ConfigMap]
    E --> F{Proxy remains healthy?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Keep ownership registration]
    G --> F
    F -->|No, threshold reached| H[Expire affected ownership records]
    G --> I[Proxy reports stream end]
    I --> J[Controller validates owner and generation]
    J --> K[Controller clears and persists stream ownership]
    K --> L([End])
    M[Worker lifecycle is outside this cleanup phase]:::note
    D -.-> M
    classDef note fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#856404,color:#533f03
